\"clarity\", \"script\", \"xqtvu7my3o\");\n            "}}]]}],["$","body",null,{"children":["$","$L2",null,{}]}]]}]],null],"route:/insights/it-advisory/":[[["$","meta",null,{"charSet":"utf-8"}],[["$","title","0",{"children":"IT顧問とは？中小企業が外部IT担当者を活用するメリットと相談できること｜株式会社HeadShot"}],["$","meta","1",{"name":"description","content":"IT顧問とは、社内ITの課題整理や改善方針、ベンダー選定、見積レビューなどを継続的に支援する外部パートナーです。中小企業で活用するメリット、相談できる内容、選び方をわかりやすく解説します。"}],["$","meta","2",{"name":"robots","content":"index, follow"}],["$","meta","3",{"property":"og:title","content":"IT顧問とは？中小企業が外部IT担当者を活用するメリットと相談できること"}],["$","meta","4",{"property":"og:description","content":"IT顧問に相談できる内容、向いている企業、導入メリット、選び方を実務目線で整理します。"}],["$","meta","5",{"property":"og:url","content":"https://headshot.co.jp/insights/it-advisory/"}],["$","meta","6",{"property":"og:site_name","content":"株式会社HeadShot"}],["$","meta","7",{"property":"og:type","content":"article"}],["$","meta","8",{"name":"twitter:card","content":"summary"}],["$","meta","9",{"name":"twitter:title","content":"IT顧問とは？中小企業が外部IT担当者を活用するメリットと相談できること"}],["$","meta","10",{"name":"twitter:description","content":"IT顧問に相談できる内容、向いている企業、導入メリット、選び方を実務目線で整理します。"}],["$","link","11",{"rel":"shortcut icon","href":"https://headshot.co.jp/favicon.svg"}],["$","link","12",{"rel":"icon","href":"https://headshot.co.jp/favicon.svg"}],["$","link","13",{"rel":"canonical","href":"https://headshot.co.jp/insights/it-advisory/"}],["$","meta","14",{"name":"codex-preview","content":"development"}]],[["$","meta","0",{"name":"viewport","content":"width=device-width, initial-scale=1"}]]],["$","$L3",null,{"segmentMap":{"children":["insights","it-advisory"]},"children":["$","$L4",null,{"id":"layout:/","parallelSlots":"$undefined","children":["$","$L5",null,{"children":["$","$L3",null,{"segmentMap":{"children":[]},"children":["$","$L4",null,{"id":"page:/insights/it-advisory/"}]}]}]}]}]],"__layoutFlags":{"layout:/":"s"},"__artifactCompatibility":{"schemaVersion":1,"graphVersion":"app-route-graph:1dcl2cktemvc8"